  "grades": {
    "decision": ["D08"],
    "rule": "formulaGrade = max(0, 10 - sum(amount of each confirmed deduction)) for counted Accepted work and 0 otherwise; each constraint deducts once. An adjustment stores amount = targetGrade - formulaGrade and replaces any earlier adjustment. grade = clamp(formulaGrade + amount, 0, 10). An accepted appeal removes one deduction and keeps the stored amount.",
